# Local overrides for the Cloudflare bindings in wrangler.jsonc.
# Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) to change them for `wrangler dev`.
#
# Contact form delivery is handled by the EMAIL binding (Cloudflare Email
# Sending), not by an API key. Recipient and sender are set as vars in
# wrangler.jsonc and can be overridden here.
#
# CONTACT_TO_EMAIL=isaiah@haceyglobal.com
# CONTACT_FROM_EMAIL=noreply@haceyglobal.com
#
# By default `wrangler dev` does NOT send real mail: Miniflare writes each
# message to .wrangler/tmp/email/. To send for real from local dev, add
# "remote": true to the send_email binding in wrangler.jsonc.
